1. Brand Philosophy
Adaptive, accessible, reactive, elegant, minimal.
Every pixel serves clarity and calm. Complexity is hidden; power is instant. Sunset orange is used only for intentional emphasis.
2. Color Palette

Background: #F8F5F0 (light) / #111111 (dark)
Surface: #FFFFFF (light) / #1C1C1C (dark)
Text Primary: #1C1C1C (light) / #F5F5F5 (dark)
Text Secondary: #666666 (light) / #AAAAAA (dark)
Border: #E5E0D8 (light) / #2A2A2A (dark)
Accent (Sunset Orange): #FF6B35 — used only for primary CTAs, active states, and critical highlights
Success: #2E8B57
Error: #E63939

3. Typography

Heading 1 (Note Title): Inter SemiBold 24px / 1.2 line height
Heading 2 (Section): Inter Medium 18px
Body Text: Inter Regular 16px / 1.6 line height
Caption / Metadata: Inter Regular 13px
All text uses font-feature-settings: "ss01" for elegance. No decorative fonts.

4. Spacing System

Base unit: 8px
Padding: 16px (standard card), 24px (sidebar), 32px (main content)
Gap between cards: 12px
Section vertical spacing: 24px
Top bar height: 56px (fixed)
Sidebar width: 240px (collapsible to 64px)

5. Official Note View Layout & Specs

Top Bar (56px height, full width)
Padding: 16px left/right
Search bar: height 40px, width 100% max 480px, rounded 9999px, background #FFFFFF / #1C1C1C
Left Sidebar (240px)
Padding: 16px top, 8px sides
Item height: 44px, padding 12px left
Icon + label gap: 12px
Main Content Area (flex-grow)
Padding: 24px top, 32px sides
Card size (List view): full width, height 72px, padding 16px, border radius 12px
Card size (Grid view): 280px × 180px, padding 20px, border radius 16px
Card internal gap: 12px
Right Sidebar (context panel, 320px)
Padding: 24px
Backlinks section: 16px vertical gap
AI Actions buttons: 40px height, 12px gap

6. Interactive States

Hover on card: subtle scale 1.02 + border #FF6B35 (1px)
Active card: left accent bar #FF6B35 (4px)
Focus states: 2px solid #FF6B35 outline
All transitions: 120ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)

7. Accessibility & Responsiveness

Minimum touch target: 44px
Contrast ratio: ≥ 4.5:1 everywhere
Fully keyboard navigable
Adaptive layout collapses sidebar on < 1024px; full mobile stack on < 640px